        "language": "rongmei",
        "title": "Kandih khou rianramei na guai",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Kandih khouhei rianramei na kabang karumei guai,",
            "Kariu pui nung poubaumei Jisu thuan kuni;",
            "Lung nchamma nang jaujianmei 2!- thuan ku khang,",
            "Kandih kapmei timan lou o.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Nang bumang rui jai lou dat ro,",
            "Kandih kapmei tan khang;",
            "Neila hou ni e nang njianmei nun,",
            "Mei guai houmu sini,",
            "He nang tikgun daimei sudiu.",
            "",
            "2. Salou chamloumei piu makmei nang pan khou rui ringni,",
            "Thukmei nangjei lat hei sathai mak khuan sini;",
            "Ching le njang kandih khou guang kariumei guai,",
            "Ti neila lou khang guang dat ro.",
            "",
            "3. He poubaumei alung rianramei ti bam sang lou ri o,",
            "He nang pan khou rui jianmei nun guai ntang the;",
            "Tingsangjanga neilamei 2!- patdiu khang rui,",
            "Mei guai lungning khou guang bammo.",
            "",
            "4. He kandih rianra kapmei guai khanga khuan bamsini,",
            "Poubaumei suaihiammei le nthuk pui jei 2!-;",
            "Meiguai nakhang neila janggaimei sudiu khang,",
            "He bumang thanmei sam kei o."
          ]
        }
      }
    },
